@baseball_game_HostAddress = http://localhost:5293

### Reset Database (Initialize Schema & Seed)
POST {{baseball_game_HostAddress}}/api/game/reset-db
Accept: application/json

###

### Simulate Full Game (Instant Result)
POST {{baseball_game_HostAddress}}/api/game/simulate
Accept: application/json

###

### SignalR Hub (WebSocket)
# Note: Use a WebSocket client to connect to {{baseball_game_HostAddress}}/gameHub
# Send: {"protocol":"json","version":1} to handshake.
# Invoke: "StartGame", "PauseGame", "ResumeGame", "RestartGame"

###

### Start New Season
# @name startSeason
POST {{baseball_game_HostAddress}}/api/season
Content-Type: application/json

2024

### Get Season Details
@seasonId = {{startSeason.response.body.id}}
GET {{baseball_game_HostAddress}}/api/season/{{seasonId}}
Accept: application/json

### Get Season Schedule
GET {{baseball_game_HostAddress}}/api/season/{{seasonId}}/schedule
Accept: application/json

### List All Teams
GET {{baseball_game_HostAddress}}/api/team
Accept: application/json

### Get Team Details
GET {{baseball_game_HostAddress}}/api/team/1
Accept: application/json

### Get Team Roster
GET {{baseball_game_HostAddress}}/api/team/1/roster
Accept: application/json
